license: MIT
keywords:
  - visuomotor manipulation
  - imitation learning
  - bimanual teleoperation
  - action chunking transformer
  - depth-assisted grasping
  - SO-101
abstract: >-
  A distributed bimanual manipulation research platform for the SO-101 arm pair:
  leader-follower teleoperation, multi-view RGB and metric wrist depth, offline
  ACT and SmolVLA policy learning, depth-assisted hybrid grasping, and
  protocol-based manipulation evaluation with per-condition success rates.
